# The model payload is fetched, not authored.
#
# Every directory under models/ carries a license.txt with the asset's
# source URL, title and author — those are tracked, because they are the
# legal record and the re-download manifest. The geometry and textures
# they describe are 487 MB of third-party binary that git cannot delta
# compress, so they ship as a release asset instead. See README.md.
models/**
!models/**/
!models/**/license.txt
!models/**/LICENSE.txt

# Render output. Reproducible from the scripts, and large.
out_*/
plates/
*.blend
*.blend1
*.exr
